      "lines": [
        "37. 积和分式的平方根"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来比较根式 $\\sqrt{81\\times4}$ 和 $\\sqrt{81}\\cdot\\sqrt{4}$ 的值：",
        "$\\sqrt{81\\times4}=\\sqrt{324}=\\sqrt{18^2}=18$，",
        "$\\sqrt{81}\\cdot\\sqrt{4}=9\\times2=18$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看到，$\\sqrt{81\\times4}=\\sqrt{81}\\cdot\\sqrt{4}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理1 如果 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b\\geq 0$，那么 $\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了证明当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b\\geq 0$ 时等式",
        "$\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$　　(1)",
        "成立，我们应当规定 $\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}\\geq 0$ 和 $(\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b})^2=ab$.",
        "于是，根据二次根式的定义，就能断定在给定的变量值下，等",
        "式（1）是正确的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1) 积 $\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}$ 是非负的，因为按照二次根式的性质，",
        "当 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b\\geq 0$ 时，根式 $\\sqrt{a}$ 和 $\\sqrt{b}$ 当中的每一个都有意义",
        "并且取非负值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2) 按照积的幂的性质，",
        "$(\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b})^2=(\\sqrt{a})^2\\cdot(\\sqrt{b})^2=ab$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，等式（1）成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，对于算术平方根来说，下面的性质成立："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "两个非负因数的积的平方根等于这两个因数的平方根的",
        "积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根号下面的因数多于两个时，定理也成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "分式的算术平方根具有类似的性质."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定理2 如果 $a\\geq 0$ 和 $b>0$，那么 $\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
